OL,3,GNEWSAWill new enforcement officers help
OL,4,Acut nuisance behaviour in
OL,5,AWolverhampton?
OL,6,
OL,7,FA team of nine enforcement officers
OL,8,Fcould be introduced to crack down on
OL,9,Fanti-social behaviour in Wolverhampton.
OL,11,FHere's what you need to know about new
OL,12,Fproposals the city council will look
OL,13,Fat.
OL,15,FThere are several recommendations to
OL,16,F"strengthen" the city's response to
OL,17,Fanti-social behaviour.
OL,19,FIf approved, #1.2m would be spent on a
OL,20,Fnew approach combining "prevention,
OL,21,Fintervention and enforcement" to tackle
OL,22,Fpersistent anti-social behaviour.
